# Cavernous Maw: "{2}: This land becomes a 3/3 Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a Cave land." The text says it is
# still what it was, so the land keeps every type and subtype it had and the Elemental type is added (CR 205.1b, 613.1d): under
# Prismatic Omen the Maw is a Forest, so Life and Limb has made it a 1/1 Saproling creature, and once animated it is a 3/3
# Saproling Elemental, its Saproling type not replaced by the Elemental one.

